    "show_share": true,
    "description": "CIME and the Section of Urology organised a simulation-based workshop on TURP (Trans-Urethral Resection of the Prostate). 21 urology residents from various institutions across Karachi had the valuable opportunity to practice TURP procedures using the VirtaMed simulator, a cutting-edge technology that provides comprehensive training on the essential skills required for performing this intervention.",
